  "body": "1. Custom Roles/Labels for member in the Room, supports custom group notifications. \r\n\r\n2. Labels/Tags for content deemed related to a theme to support faster search in long threads with many members. \r\n\r\nDiscord has role methods to be able to assign members to sub groups to ping just those necessary for specific topics. \r\n\r\n(@.1) Implement a system to have member roles/labels where all assigned have an @\"role\" ping for notifications and searchable history around that role/label. \r\n\r\n(@.2) Allow content on a subject to be tagged or labeled to support search in long threads. (much like github labels) (@.2)\r\n",
